Use buffered output — build string or use ostream with sync off. Recursion could be depth 20 fine. But 1M recursive calls with printf maybe slow; use string buffer with to_string. Better append to std::string then fwrite. Moves ~1M lines * ~6 bytes = 6MB fine.

